[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10921.51, "timestamp": "03:02:01", "text": "Veile遊戲玩家的兒子在這裡嗎？如果你現在正在聊天，請嘗試開啟禮物設置，以便接收其他人贈送的禮物。好像有份禮物還沒收到，對吧？因為 Roku 做了三次。一二三。三次。所以，這三位沒有會員資格的人，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10924.309, "timestamp": "03:02:04", "text": "他們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10926.95, "timestamp": "03:02:06", "text": "開啟了贈送設置，就可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10929.309, "timestamp": "03:02:09", "text": "免費獲得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10931.67, "timestamp": "03:02:11", "text": "。  嗯，我想那會有幫助的。置頂訊息。哦，是的。是的。是的。  是的。是的。  是的。你必須這樣做。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10950.701, "timestamp": "03:02:30", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "pin a message"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10957.309, "timestamp": "03:02:37", "text": "呃 [音樂] [音樂] 呃呃，等等。  嗯，我可以把它置頂。請"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10959.83, "timestamp": "03:02:39", "text": "開啟您的會員登入功能。  呃，接收，呃，得到接收。  收到。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10973.871, "timestamp": "03:02:53", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "PLS- turn on your Allow Gifts feature in your membership settings"}]